"<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>Digest 2026-11-03</title><style>
:root{color-scheme:light dark;--bg:#fbfbf9;--fg:#1c1c1e;--muted:#6b6b70;--card:#ffffff;--line:#e3e3df;--accent:#0b57d0;--warn-bg:#fff4d6;--warn-fg:#5c4300}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){:root{--bg:#121214;--fg:#ececee;--muted:#9a9aa1;--card:#1c1c20;--line:#2e2e33;--accent:#8ab4f8;--warn-bg:#3a3012;--warn-fg:#f3dc9a}}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font:18px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
main{max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px}
a{color:var(--accent)}
h1{font-size:1.6rem;margin:.2em 0}
h2{font-size:1.3rem;margin:1.6em 0 .6em;padding-top:.4em;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
h3{font-size:1.05rem;margin:1.2em 0 .4em;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em}
.meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}
.warn{background:var(--warn-bg);color:var(--warn-fg);padding:.6em .9em;border-radius:10px;margin:.6em 0}
nav ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:.5em 0}
nav a{display:block;padding:.7em 0;min-height:44px;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:12px;margin:12px 0}
.card img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px;background:var(--line);margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem}
.card h4{font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.3;margin:.2em 0}
.card h4 a{display:block;padding:.2em 0;min-height:44px}
.reason{font-style:italic}
.desc{color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem}
details{margin:.5em 0}
summary{cursor:pointer;padding:.6em 0;min-height:44px;color:var(--accent)}
details p{white-space:pre-wrap;margin:.3em 0}
.compact{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}
.compact li{padding:.55em 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.compact a{display:inline-block;min-height:44px;line-height:44px}
footer{margin-top:2em;padding-top:1em;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem}
.headlines{padding-left:1.2em;margin:.4em 0}
.headlines li{margin:.45em 0;font-weight:600}
.story h4{font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.3;margin:.1em 0 .3em}
.story p{margin:.3em 0 .5em}
.story .meta a{display:inline-block;min-height:44px;line-height:44px}
</style></head><body><main><header><h1>Digest 2026-11-03</h1><div class="meta">2 videos · 1 story from 4 posts</div><div class="warn" role="alert">X needs login: run \`digister x login\`</div></header><nav aria-label="Contents"><ul><li><a href="#today">Today in 60 seconds</a></li><li><a href="#must-watch">Must watch today (1)</a></li><li><a href="#stories">Stories (1)</a></li><li><a href="#quick-hits">Quick hits (1)</a></li><li><a href="#more-posts">More posts</a></li><li><a href="#also-new">Also new from your channels (1)</a></li></ul></nav><section id="today"><h2>Today in 60 seconds</h2><ul class="headlines"><li>Qwen 4 is out</li><li>AI SDK 7 changes tools</li></ul></section><section id="must-watch"><h2>Must watch today</h2><article class="card"><img src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/v1/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Thumbnail: Title v1" loading="lazy" width="640" height="360"/><h4><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v1">Title v1</a></h4><div class="meta">Fireship · 12:34</div><p class="reason">Matches local AI</p><p class="desc">Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc Desc </p></article></section><section id="stories"><h2>Stories</h2><div id="topic-ai"><h3>AI</h3><article class="card story"><h4>Qwen 4 released</h4><p>Three people tested it.</p><div class="meta">2 posts · <span><a href="https://x.com/alice/status/p1">@alice</a></span><span> · <a href="https://x.com/alice/status/p2">@bob</a></span></div></article></div></section><section id="quick-hits"><h2>Quick hits</h2><ul class="compact"><li>Bun 2 ships a faster installer <a href="https://x.com/alice/status/p4">@carol</a></li></ul></section><section id="more-posts"><h2>More posts</h2><ul class="compact"><li><a href="https://x.com/alice/status/p3">A side note.</a><div class